ase target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nProposal to Fix Inconsistent Behavior in is_valid_ip_address() for IPv6 Addresses with Multiple ::\r\nFixes: #99623 \r\n\r\nThis pull request resolves inconsistent behavior in the is_valid_ip_address() method when validating IPv6 addresses. Specifically, it addresses the following issues:\r\n\r\nOld behavior:\r\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15059349-339e-482d-8247-c9d527ca5e76\" alt=\"issue_image\" width=\"400\">\r\n\r\nNew behavior:\r\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f50ed302-88fa-4894-8031-cb9bad9b2b97\" alt=\"fixed_issue_image\" width=\"400\">\r\n\r\n\r\nThe updated is_valid_ip_address() method tracks :: with double_colon_index, ensuring only one occurrence. It validates segment counts, handles compressed zeros logically, and strictly enforces IPv4-mapped segments in the final position. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-11-24T12:07:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T1